    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Okko The Exiled is an action-packed adventure where you stomp, launch, and bash your way through Kutala, a land of demons, on a quest to defeat the Demon Lord Yalda and link Okko\u2019s isolated world with the heavens.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After 1,000 years of concealment, Okko is ready to wield the Mighty Fang and take down Kutala\u2019s lords one by one. Defeat powerful foes, overcome obstacles, and unleash your heart as Okko fights to fulfill an ancient oath.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3479420/extras/b1da7371477f7c948fa46dc9de865220.poster.avif?t=1755507639\" width=126 height=163 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3479420/extras/b1da7371477f7c948fa46dc9de865220.webm?t=1755507639\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3479420/extras/c764c9366152cc21e70dd571b64223cc.poster.avif?t=1755507639\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3479420/extras/c764c9366152cc21e70dd571b64223cc.apng?t=1755507639\" class=\"bb_img\" width=144 height=141 /></picture></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3479420/extras/5d864a8859488175d4c6657b17f7b731.poster.avif?t=1755507639\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3479420/extras/5d864a8859488175d4c6657b17f7b731.apng?t=1755507639\" class=\"bb_img\" width=92 height=99 /></picture></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3479420/extras/c423fe386fa84f15905bbab527a1c3b5.poster.avif?t=1755507639\" width=152 height=156 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3479420/extras/c423fe386fa84f15905bbab527a1c3b5.webm?t=1755507639\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Vibrant, hand-drawn pixel art brings Okko\u2019s world path of destruction to life as he explores the demon lands of Kutala.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Captivating soundtrack composed by an industry veteran to immerse you in Okko\u2019s epic journey!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Focus Mode: consume Heart Energy and time Okko\u2019s attacks to inflict extra damage on enemies and break their shields!\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Launch, Stomp, Bounce, Shoot, Deflect, and more, as you send enemies flying across the screen, pop them into the air, and link attacks to form devastating combos!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fill your belly, trade goods, and chat up a colorful cast of characters at The Old Throne, a place of respite, while also uncovering the secrets of its depths.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Expressive character portraits bring Okko's dialogue to life as the story unfolds!\u00a0</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upgrade Okko\u2019s stats and unlock new abilities to give Okko an edge in combat and exploration!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Challenge yourself with OHKO Mode, New Game+, and Boss Rush!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3479420/extras/c3a493d9ad8c580055c79109a9e1a9ed.poster.avif?t=1755507639\" width=174 height=208 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3479420/extras/c3a493d9ad8c580055c79109a9e1a9ed.webm?t=1755507639\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3479420/extras/2246c3a36a4a68030227dcdd9ce0069d.poster.avif?t=1755507639\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3479420/extras/2246c3a36a4a68030227dcdd9ce0069d.apng?t=1755507639\" class=\"bb_img\" width=108 height=106 /></picture></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3479420/extras/da5ad72a74354916e732bd162868bb41.poster.avif?t=1755507639\" width=194 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3479420/extras/da5ad72a74354916e732bd162868bb41.webm?t=1755507639\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Okko The Exiled is an action-packed adventure where you stomp, launch, and bash your way through Kutala, a land of demons, on a quest to defeat the Demon Lord Yalda and link Okko\u2019s isolated world with the heavens.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After 1,000 years of concealment, Okko is ready to wield the Mighty Fang and take down Kutala\u2019s lords one by one. Defeat powerful foes, overcome obstacles, and unleash your heart as Okko fights to fulfill an ancient oath.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3479420/extras/b1da7371477f7c948fa46dc9de865220.poster.avif?t=1755507639\" width=126 height=163 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3479420/extras/b1da7371477f7c948fa46dc9de865220.webm?t=1755507639\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3479420/extras/c764c9366152cc21e70dd571b64223cc.poster.avif?t=1755507639\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3479420/extras/c764c9366152cc21e70dd571b64223cc.apng?t=1755507639\" class=\"bb_img\" width=144 height=141 /></picture></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3479420/extras/5d864a8859488175d4c6657b17f7b731.poster.avif?t=1755507639\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3479420/extras/5d864a8859488175d4c6657b17f7b731.apng?t=1755507639\" class=\"bb_img\" width=92 height=99 /></picture></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3479420/extras/c423fe386fa84f15905bbab527a1c3b5.poster.avif?t=1755507639\" width=152 height=156 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3479420/extras/c423fe386fa84f15905bbab527a1c3b5.webm?t=1755507639\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Vibrant, hand-drawn pixel art brings Okko\u2019s world path of destruction to life as he explores the demon lands of Kutala.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Captivating soundtrack composed by an industry veteran to immerse you in Okko\u2019s epic journey!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Focus Mode: consume Heart Energy and time Okko\u2019s attacks to inflict extra damage on enemies and break their shields!\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Launch, Stomp, Bounce, Shoot, Deflect, and more, as you send enemies flying across the screen, pop them into the air, and link attacks to form devastating combos!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fill your belly, trade goods, and chat up a colorful cast of characters at The Old Throne, a place of respite, while also uncovering the secrets of its depths.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Expressive character portraits bring Okko's dialogue to life as the story unfolds!\u00a0</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upgrade Okko\u2019s stats and unlock new abilities to give Okko an edge in combat and exploration!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Challenge yourself with OHKO Mode, New Game+, and Boss Rush!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3479420/extras/c3a493d9ad8c580055c79109a9e1a9ed.poster.avif?t=1755507639\" width=174 height=208 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3479420/extras/c3a493d9ad8c580055c79109a9e1a9ed.webm?t=1755507639\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3479420/extras/2246c3a36a4a68030227dcdd9ce0069d.poster.avif?t=1755507639\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3479420/extras/2246c3a36a4a68030227dcdd9ce0069d.apng?t=1755507639\" class=\"bb_img\" width=108 height=106 /></picture></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3479420/extras/da5ad72a74354916e732bd162868bb41.poster.avif?t=1755507639\" width=194 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3479420/extras/da5ad72a74354916e732bd162868bb41.webm?t=1755507639\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p>",
